###Friends

###Send a friend request
POST {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}"
}

###Accept a friend request
POST {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/requests/{{username}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Decline a friend request, or cancel one you sent
DELETE {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/requests/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Unfriend a user
DELETE {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Block a user
PUT {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/blocked/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Unblock a user
DELETE {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/blocked/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Get all friends of a user
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Get all pending friend requests
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Get all friend requests you have sent
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/requests?direction=outgoing
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Get all blocked users
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/friends/blocked
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
